{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LetDeco Demo includes the following game content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the tutorial, you will learn how to collect materials and make furniture while helping Cheese Cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can decorate Cheese Cat's house, a cafe in a cherry blossom forest, and a campsite surrounded by ginkgo trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, 80 types of furniture that can be made are available in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956100/extras/58d6dfac4ee5e8ff7c5cf3e30b4f9ac3.poster.avif?t=1756202180\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956100/extras/58d6dfac4ee5e8ff7c5cf3e30b4f9ac3.webm?t=1756202180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956100/extras/58d6dfac4ee5e8ff7c5cf3e30b4f9ac3.mp4?t=1756202180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gathering materials</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials from plants, rocks, and more in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even collect old cloth and cherries to make pink cloth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, rare materials can be hard to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956100/extras/3bc67982be5261b4193541b61f19ac09.poster.avif?t=1756202180\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956100/extras/3bc67982be5261b4193541b61f19ac09.webm?t=1756202180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956100/extras/3bc67982be5261b4193541b61f19ac09.mp4?t=1756202180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate the house</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your cute little puppet friend's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize it with a variety of homemade furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also a bunny cafe and a chick campground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956100/extras/6e8c256516d824a8217aa8509ceca487.poster.avif?t=1756202180\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956100/extras/6e8c256516d824a8217aa8509ceca487.webm?t=1756202180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956100/extras/6e8c256516d824a8217aa8509ceca487.mp4?t=1756202180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome obstacles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different areas, each with their own unique features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And face the obstacles you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard work pays off!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956100?t=1756202180","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956100?t=1756202180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956100/0536cb8d7eee88f58fa382a92a81c195c3c72ff8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756202180","ca